    "rich_text_6aeaLY": {
      "type": "rich_text",
      "name": "Rich Text",
      "settings": {
        "richtext_inhalt": "<h3>THE PRODUCT PORTFOLIO FOR THE MODERN WORKPLACE</h3><p><strong>CONNECTIVITY – THE INVISIBLE BOTTLE NECK</strong></p><p>USB-C hubs, HDMI adaptors, multi-port docking solutions: these items are indispensable in the modern laptop environment – yet they are regularly overlooked. Anyone who buys a MacBook Air or a Surface device without an adapter will realise, at the very latest during their first presentation, that they’re missing an HDMI port.<br/>DICOTA offers a wide range of connectivity products that integrate seamlessly into the workplace setup. For resellers, this is a classic add-on item with a high contribution margin and minimal need for explanation.</p><p><strong><br/>ERGONOMICS – AN INVESTMENT IN PRODUCTIVITY</strong></p><p>Laptop stands, monitor risers and ergonomic aids have become an integral part of everyday corporate life since the mandatory period of working from home. Many companies have introduced minimum ergonomic standards that also apply when working from home – thereby creating a lasting demand for ergonomic accessories.<br/>For HR managers, this is an issue that goes beyond IT: ergonomics is about health and safety, and health and safety is an employer’s duty. Resellers who highlight this connection in their discussions can tap into a budget segment that does not compete with the traditional IT budget.</p><p><br/><strong>PROTECTION & TRANSPORT – THE DAILY COMPANION</strong></p><p>Sleeves, cases and bags aren’t just for protecting devices – they’re the first thing a new employee gets their hands on. A high-quality, well-designed package sends a clear message: this company invests in its staff. This is a subtle but real factor in staff satisfaction.<br/>For resellers, this means that workplace accessories are not a commodity business, but a service offering. Those who position them as part of the onboarding package secure a recurring order for every new employee.</p>",
        "width": "narrow",
        "padding_top": 4,
        "padding_bottom": 4
      }
    },
